    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nNo.40 Ladycove is an exceptional two-bedroom ground floor apartment, superbly positioned just off Palmer Road, only moments from the picturesque North Beach in the heart of Rush.\n\nPresented in immaculate, show house condition, this beautifully appointed residence has been finished to an exceptional standard throughout, offering a perfect balance of contemporary style, comfort and practicality. Cleverly designed to maximise both space and natural light, the apartment enjoys an impressive open-plan living, dining and kitchen area, creating a bright and welcoming environment ideal for modern living and entertaining alike.\n\nThe well-proportioned accommodation continues with two generous double bedrooms positioned to the front of the property, including a luxurious principal bedroom with en-suite, together with a stylish main bathroom, a separate utility room and an invaluable cloakroom, all thoughtfully designed to enhance everyday living.\n\nLadycove enjoys an enviable coastal setting within easy walking distance of Rush village, where an excellent selection of cafés, restaurants, shops, pubs and everyday amenities can be found. The beautiful North and South beaches are just a short stroll away, offering an exceptional seaside lifestyle, while the renowned Millbank Theatre, Tesco supermarket, and both excellent primary and secondary schools are all close at hand.\n\nFor commuters, Rush/Lusk Train Station is just a five-minute drive away, while regular Dublin Bus services and convenient access to the M1, M50 and Dublin Airport—approximately 20 minutes away—ensure excellent connectivity to Dublin City and beyond.\n\nCombining an outstanding location, elegant interiors and a turnkey finish, No. Ladycove presents a rare opportunity to acquire a truly exceptional coastal home. Early viewing is highly recommended to fully appreciate everything this beautiful apartment has to offer."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> Ground Floor Apartment</li><li> Double Glazed Windows</li><li> Main Bedroom En-suite</li><li> Designated Parking Space</li><li> Over Looking an Open Green</li><li> Private Patio Area</li><li> Utility Room</li><li> Spacious Living Accommodation</li><li> Management Fee Approx. 1,400 p.a.</ul>"
      },
